    {
     "titel": "Präsens: alle 6 Personen auf einen Blick",
     "text": "<p class='klein'><span style='color:#3c7a5a;font-weight:800'>می‌</span> + <span style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>Präsensstamm</span> + <span style='color:#b5525a;font-weight:800'>Endung</span></p><p><b>می‌</b> steht vorn (mit Halbabstand), dann der <b>Präsensstamm</b>, dann die <b>Endung</b> – bei <b>او</b> jetzt <b>-ad</b>.</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0;direction:rtl'><tr><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd)'></th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>خورد<span style='color:#9aa3a0'>َن</span></span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>essen · Stamm <span class='fa' style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>خور</span></div></th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>رَفت<span style='color:#9aa3a0'>َن</span></span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>gehen · Stamm <span class='fa' style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>رَو</span></div></th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>دید<span style='color:#9aa3a0'>َن</span></span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>sehen · Stamm <span class='fa' style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>بین</span></div></th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>خواند<span style='color:#9aa3a0'>َن</span></span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>lesen · Stamm <span class='fa' style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight