    {
     "titel": "Gestern ↔ jeden Tag",
     "stil": "merke",
     "text": "<p>Jedes Verb hat <b>zwei Stämme</b>: den Vergangenheitsstamm (Infinitiv ohne -an) und den <b>Präsensstamm</b> – den muss man mitlernen.</p><table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0'><tr><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);text-align:right'>Infinitiv</th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);text-align:right'>gestern: ich …</th><th style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);text-align:right'>jeden Tag: ich …</th></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>رَفتَن</span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>gehen</div></td><td style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'><span style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>رَفت‍</span><span style='color:#b5525a;font-weight:800'>‍َم</span></span></td><td style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'><span style='color:#3c7a5a;font-weight:800'>می‌</span><span style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>رَو</span><span style='color:#b5525a;font-weight:800'>َم</span></span></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'>آمَدَن</span><div class='klein' style='font-family:inherit;direction:ltr;text-align:right'>kommen</div></td><td style='padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--linie,#ddd);font-family:var(--fa);direction:rtl;text-align:right;font-size:1.35em'><span class='fa'><span style='color:#2f5d7c;font-weight:700'>آمَد</span><span style='color:#b5525a;font-weight:800'>َم</span></span></td><td style='padding:6px 8px;bor